Yes, it sucks.  I feel with you.  And an uncursed magic lamp probably
wouldn't have prevented the death, even if you had known of the
impending death ray — the chance that you get a wish out of it in a
single turn is below 7%.  And anyway you'd have needed a second turn to
actually wear the shield…

